Third-party / vendored material
-------------------------------
tests/reference/ is a copy, made on 2026-11-08, of parts of the "circuit-a2a" project (the original circuit
agent that logitration reimplements as a general library), by the same author, MIT License
(tests/reference/LICENSE-MIT). Copied unchanged:
  tests/reference/src/circuit_a2a/   (the original core and its plain-Python simulator)
  tests/reference/src/circuit/       (its Prolog sources, e.g. events.pl)
  tests/reference/src/metainterp/    (its meta-interpreters)
  tests/reference/examples/scenarios/ (house, workshop, garage)
It is used only by tests/test_library.py (section 1: the library's circuit example is compared, step by step,
with the original). It is not part of the installed package and the BSL does not apply to it: it stays MIT.

