Bundled package
---------------
src/logitration/edificio_pyro_0.9.3.tar.gz is the building package (edificio.py, the A2A server and the session anchor) used by
`logi building`, by the same author, copied unchanged and checked at install time against a fixed sha256. It is under the same
license as this library (BSL 1.1). It carries no credentials.

src/logitration/percebe_local/ is the screen of `logi building` (the street-building view of the rooms and their chat), by the same author: the screen
of his own building, rebuilt by a script that removes everything specific to his machines (comments, hosts, accounts, internal names) and adds the local
code (mailbox delivery, permission answer, access secret). Same license as this library (BSL 1.1). It carries no credentials. The waiting-time games and
the chess engine of the original screen are not included.
